<div style="width:1366px;height:768px;overflow:hidden;padding:16px">

<div class="card top">
  <h1>つなぐ工房</h1>
  <span class="cap">ロンリ回路をくみたてる</span>
  <div class="chips">
    <div class="chip te"><span class="k">A</span><span class="v">1</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">B</span><span class="v">0</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">OUT Y</span><span class="v">0</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">ためした</span><span class="v">3/4</span></div>
    <div class="chip"><span class="k">バン</span><span class="v" style="font-size:10.5px;padding:3px 0">26-09-14a</span></div>
  </div>
  <span class="btn pk">■ 編集にもどる</span>
</div>

<div class="tabs">
  <span class="tg">キホン</span>
  <span class="t dn">01 スイッチ</span><span class="t cu">02 直列</span><span class="t">03 並列</span>
  <span class="t">04 NOT</span><span class="t">05 真理値表</span>
  <span class="tg" style="margin-left:9px">カダイ</span>
  <span class="t">06 XOR</span><span class="t">07 半加算器</span><span class="t">08 全加算器</span><span class="t">09 4ビット</span>
</div>

<div class="cols">
  <main>
    <div class="card pad" style="margin-bottom:13px">
      <h2>課題02　二つのスイッチを一本道にする</h2>
      <p class="txt">スイッチ A と B を、電池からランプまで <em>一本道</em> に並べなさい。
        どちらか片方だけ入れても、ランプは点きません。</p>
      <p class="sm">右のスイッチを切りかえて、4 とおり全部をためしなさい。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card pad">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">BOARD</span><span class="st te">運転中　／　回路は編集できません</span></div>
      <div class="scr">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 700 262" width="100%" height="206" role="img" aria-label="配線盤">
          <rect x="30" y="28" width="8" height="206" rx="4" fill="#0d9488"/>
          <rect x="662" y="28" width="8" height="206" rx="4" fill="#1b1340"/>
          <text x="34" y="20" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#0d9488">＋</text>
          <text x="666" y="20" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1b1340">−</text>
          <g stroke="#0d9488" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round">
            <line x1="38" y1="132" x2="156" y2="132"/><line x1="156" y1="132" x2="224" y2="132"/>
            <line x1="224" y1="132" x2="336" y2="132"/></g>
          <g stroke="#d8d2ee" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round">
            <line x1="404" y1="132" x2="516" y2="132"/><line x1="574" y1="132" x2="662" y2="132"/></g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="156" cy="132" r="7" fill="#1b1340"/><circle cx="224" cy="132" r="7" fill="#1b1340"/>
            <rect x="150" y="88" width="82" height="26" rx="9" fill="#0d9488"/>
            <text x="191" y="106" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff">A ＝ 1</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="336" cy="132" r="7" fill="#1b1340"/><circle cx="404" cy="132" r="7" fill="#1b1340"/>
            <line x1="336" y1="132" x2="398" y2="102" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="330" y="60" width="82" height="26" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <text x="371" y="78" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#1b1340">B ＝ 0</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="545" cy="132" r="27" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="5"/>
            <line x1="528" y1="115" x2="562" y2="149" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <line x1="528" y1="149" x2="562" y2="115" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="504" y="84" width="82" height="26" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#1b1340" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <text x="545" y="102" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="900" fill="#1b1340">Y ＝ 0</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <rect x="288" y="178" width="228" height="32" rx="11" fill="#db2777"/>
            <text x="402" y="199" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">B が開いている　ここで止まる</text>
          </g>
          <line x1="404" y1="142" x2="396" y2="176" stroke="#db2777" stroke-width="3"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <aside>
    <div class="card pad" style="margin-bottom:13px">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">INPUT</span><span class="st">タップで切りかえ</span></div>
      <div class="sws">
        <div class="sb on"><div class="k">SW A</div><div class="v">1</div></div>
        <div class="sb"><div class="k">SW B</div><div class="v">0</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lamp"><i></i>ランプ Y<span class="v">0</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card pad">
      <div class="hdr"><span class="bg">TRUTH</span><span class="st">全部ためすと たしかめる が押せる</span></div>
      <div class="rows">
        <div class="r"><span class="p">0</span><span class="p">0</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="os"><span class="o">0</span></span></div>
        <div class="r"><span class="p">0</span><span class="p">1</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="os"><span class="o">0</span></span></div>
        <div class="r now"><span class="p">1</span><span class="p">0</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="os"><span class="o">0</span></span></div>
        <div class="r wait"><span class="p">1</span><span class="p">1</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="os"><span class="o">?</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rem">のこり 1 とおり</div>
    </div>

    <div class="bts">
      <span class="btn x">たしかめる</span>
      <span class="btn o">ヒント</span>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

</div>
</x-dc>
</body>
</html>
